  "document": "Arismendi (surname)\nArismendi is a Basque surname. The Basque people are indigenous to the area of northeast Spain and southwest France, a historical region known as the Basque Country. Arismendi means \"mountain of oaks\"; \"aris\" meaning \"oak\" and \"mendi\" meaning \"mountain.\""
